<title>JAPAN: Nomura says to hold news briefing on finance unit. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Nomura says to hold news briefing on finance unit. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Thursday it would hold a news conference at 4.30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on its support for its unit Nomura Finance Co Ltd.  </p>
<p>(Corrects name of company from Nomura Co Ltd)</p>
</text>
